Verified on Samsung Galaxy A12 (Android 11) using build from {{release/CA.52.1}} / {{493c40ca8f5746bd2e584d2f5499b950d6c186f3}}. The issue is fixed - the app requests {{/getPickupData}}:

* when pin is moved
* after set {{"polling_interval_ms"}}

To display the changes, proposed change in getPickupData/getDropoffData

{noformat}"ui_data": {
        "title_html": "Please select a time after 8:20",
        "description_html": "You can't reserve a ride less than 30 minutes before pick-up",
        "price_html?": nil,
        "is_valid_point": false,
        "snackbar?": nil,
        "pin?": nil
}{noformat}

The doc for the endpoint can be found here [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/3496181904/Smart+Dropoff+endpoint|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/3496181904/Smart+Dropoff+endpoint|smart-link]

